{
  "$comment": [
    "The pack registry — every piece of domain vocabulary the UI is allowed to say.",
    "",
    "The engine knows no domain (PHASE_PLAN.md Phase 1). A pack supplies the nouns, the operator",
    "surfaces and the demo trials for one vertical; the components render whatever the active pack",
    "hands them. Nothing under app/, components/ or lib/ may contain a domain literal — that is what",
    "this file is for, and a grep gate enforces it.",
    "",
    "This file is the FALLBACK. `lib/packs.ts` asks the gateway for `GET /packs` first and only uses",
    "these values when the gateway does not serve that route yet (workstream 1C owns it). Both shapes",
    "are the same, so the switch is a delete here, not a refactor.",
    "",
    "Synthetic data only. Every id below names a row in this repository's synthetic corpus."
  ],
